## Add User

We will now add a new user to the cluster.  This will be used later to run a
test job.

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
```bash
useradd -m test
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->

Warewulf's `wwclient` on each compute node pulls the runtime overlay, which
carries the user and group files, every `update interval` seconds set in
`warewulf.conf`. Rebuild the overlay, then have `wwclient` pull it now rather
than at its next interval:

<!-- ohpc_begin -->
```bash
wwctl overlay build
pdsh -w "${compute_prefix}[1-${num_computes}]" systemctl reload wwclient
```
<!-- ohpc_end -->

Continue after the user is present on every compute node. To check one node:

```bash
ssh ${compute_prefix}1 getent passwd test
```

